nits for subjects offered by that administrative department in 2024, the department name, the coefficient of variation (using STDDEV only and never STDDEV_POP) of the total units for subjects offered by that department in regular academic terms, and the number of subjects offered by that department in regular academic terms. Do not return any rounded answers."
